# (row 69) and model-selector-usage-parity (row 71). Carries the re-derived payload of
# session-agent-selector (row 65): the mobile-invented shouldShowAgentSelector({android,
# preference, agents}) helper (b-blob c97ec4f has no upstream ancestor) re-landed in agent.ts,
# selection.tsx split into desktopAgentsVisible (v2.2.7 desktop semantics, now also gating the
# v2.2.7 list()[0]?.name default-agent fallback) and the Android-aware agentsVisible, and the
